# OAS firmware — local .gitignore
#
# The project root .gitignore already covers most of this, but this local
# file is a defense-in-depth layer so accidental `git add` from inside
# firmware/ never picks up secrets or build artifacts.

# Secrets — NEVER commit
secrets.yaml
esphome/secrets.yaml
**/secrets.yaml

# ESPHome build state
.esphome/
esphome/.esphome/
**/.esphome/
build/
**/build/

# Compiled firmware blobs (regenerable by ESPHome)
*.bin
*.elf
*.map

# Per-device override files (typically anonymized, but the user may set
# `secrets.yaml`-equivalent values inline — safer to gitignore by default).
# Remove this line if you want to commit anonymized device examples.
esphome/devices/

# Editor / OS scratch
*.swp
*~
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
